  "source": "NYC Administrative Code §28-320.3.1.1 (base coefficients: utility electricity, natural gas, district steam, fuel oils) as applied by 1 RCNY §103-14(d)(3)(i) for calendar years 2024–2034; additional on-premises fuels per §103-14(d)(3)(i)(a).",
  "sourceUrl": "https://www.nyc.gov/site/buildings/codes/rules.page",
  "sourceSha256": "",
  "retrievedAt": "2026-09-05",
  "effectiveFrom": "2024-01-01",
  "appliesToFilingYears": [2024, 2025, 2026, 2027, 2028, 2029, 2030, 2031, 2032, 2033, 2034],
  "status": "partial",
  "notes": [
    "Coverage: calendar years 2024–2034 only. §103-14(d)(3)(i) applies the §28-320.3.1.1 coefficients to 2024–2034 'except as provided in this subparagraph (i) or in subparagraph (ii)'. No coefficient is stored for 2035–2039 or 2040–2049; computeEmissions refuses those periods rather than reusing 2030–2034 values.",
    "Electricity: 0.000288962 tCO2e/kWh for 2024–2029 per §28-320.3.1.1. The 2030–2034 value (0.000145) reflects DOB's projected grid decarbonization and is expected to be set by §103-14(d)(3)(ii) — the owner-supplied text stops at (d)(3)(i)(b) 'Exceptions'; VERIFY the 2030–2034 electricity (and district steam) values against (d)(3)(ii).",
    "Base building fuels (electricity, natural_gas, district_steam, fuel_oil_2) carried from the live v1 tool. The remaining rows are the on-premises fuels listed verbatim in §103-14(d)(3)(i)(a), tCO2e per kBtu, identical across 2024–2034. Added in 1.1.0: fuel_gas (0.00005925) and biofuel (0.00007389).",
    "PENDING (not in this file): fuel_oil_4, fuel_oil_5, fuel_oil_6, district_chilled_water — these sit in §28-320.3.1.1 and were not in the supplied text.",
    "sourceSha256 to be filled by `pnpm audit:rulesets` once the canonical PDF is pinned."
  ],
